<Layout title="Style guide — Simple Things"><section class="style-guide"><p class="eyebrow">Simple Things / Design system</p><h1>The everyday, elevated.</h1><h2>Palette</h2><div class="guide-colors"><div class="guide-swatch">Cream<br />#f6f2e5</div><div class="guide-swatch-dark">Ink<br />#141211</div><div class="guide-swatch-footer">Footer<br />#ede8da</div></div><h2>Typography</h2><p class="eyebrow">Switzer semibold / 15px / uppercase</p><p class="intro-heading">Switzer, with <em>PP Editorial New Italic</em> for emphasis.</p><h2>Spacing & components</h2><p>Desktop gutter 32px · Mobile gutter 16px · Sections 80px / 48px · Square imagery, no rounded cards or shadows.</p></section></Layout>
